sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Teacher
    participant SPA as GradeWritten.tsx
    participant API as /api
    participant H as submission.GradeSubmission
    participant FA as judge0.FinalizeAttempt
    participant DB as Postgres

    Note over SPA: Pending queue is loaded from existing submissions list filtered by status="pending_review"
    T->>SPA: review answer, set score + feedback
    SPA->>API: PUT /submissions/:id/grade {score, status, teacher_feedback}
    API->>H: GradeSubmission
    H->>DB: SELECT submission, exam (verify ownership)
    alt teacher owns the exam
        H->>DB: UPDATE submission.score, status, feedback
        H->>FA: FinalizeAttempt(attempt_id)
        FA->>DB: re-aggregate attempt.score
        FA->>DB: maybe send "Exam Graded" notification
        H-->>SPA: 200 sub
    else not owner
        H-->>SPA: 403 not authorized
    end
